OpenCodeClaude Desktop <p>Add to <code>.opencode/opencode.json</code>:</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcp": {
    "memini-ai-dev": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["uvx", "--from", "memini-ai-dev", "memini-ai", "--stdio"],
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Or use the init CLI: <code>memini-ai init --homedir</code> (writes the global config) and <code>memini-ai init --project</code> (writes a project-local config).</p> <p>Add to your <code>claude_desktop_config.json</code>:</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "memini-ai-dev": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["--from", "memini-ai-dev", "memini-ai", "--stdio"]
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>
